---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Social Security Bronx.">
  <div class="container article">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">This privacy policy explains how Social Security Bronx handles information collected through this website.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect standard server logs (IP address, browser, pages visited, timestamps) automatically for site operation and security. We do not ask for or store personal data such as your name, Social Security number, or contact details unless you voluntarily contact us.</p>
    <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>We use standard analytics to understand site usage. We may display advertising from third parties (including Google AdSense), which may use cookies to serve relevant ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising through the relevant ad networks.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site may use cookies for site functionality, analytics, and advertising. You can disable cookies in your browser settings; some site features may not work without them.</p>
    <h2>Your privacy and the SSA</h2>
    <p>Social Security Bronx does not collect, store or transmit your Social Security number, banking information, or other sensitive personal data. Never enter sensitive personal information into any third-party site claiming to be the SSA. Official services are only at <a href="https://www.ssa.gov">ssa.gov</a>.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, contact us via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>


<style>
  .article-page { padding: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-8); }
  .article-page header { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); padding-bottom: var(--space-5); border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--color-ink); }
  .article-page h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  .article-page .lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .article-page .body { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .article-page .body h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); padding-bottom: var(--space-2); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-ink); }
  .article-page .body p { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .article-page .body a { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .article-page .body ul { padding-left: var(--space-5); }
  .article-page .body li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .article-page .eyebrow-row { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>

